<view class="screen">
 <view wx:if="{{mock}}" class="notice">模拟模式 · 统计和授权好友均为演示数据，与本机创建的申请无关</view>
 <view class="hero stack"><view class="title">消费统计</view><view class="muted">回顾每次决定，慢慢找到适合自己的消费习惯。</view></view>
 <view class="panel stack"><view class="heading">选择统计范围</view><picker mode="date" fields="month" value="{{period}}" end="{{today}}" bindchange="monthChanged"><view class="input">截至月份 {{period}}　选择 ›</view></picker><view class="options"><button class="option {{range === 'SIX' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-range="SIX" bindtap="rangeChanged">近六个月</button><button class="option {{range === 'MONTH' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-range="MONTH" bindtap="rangeChanged">仅该月</button></view><view class="muted">最晚选择当前月份；本月统计截止到当前系统时间，历史月份截止到月末。标签筛选影响个人概览与趋势，PK展示所选单月。</view></view>
 <view class="form-hint">实际统计时间：{{rangeLabel}}</view>
 <picker mode="selector" range="{{tagOptions}}" value="{{tagIndex}}" bindchange="tagChanged"><view class="filter-select"><view class="filter-name">消费标签筛选</view><view class="filter-value"><text>{{tag || '全部'}}</text><text class="filter-chevron">⌄</text></view></view></picker>
 <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在更新统计…</view>
 <view wx:if="{{dashboardError}}" class="error">个人概览：{{dashboardError}}</view>
 <block wx:if="{{dashboard}}"><view class="panel stack"><view class="heading">个人概览</view><view class="total">{{dashboard.total_count}}<text class="muted"> 次申请</text></view><view class="rates"><view><view class="muted">通过率</view><view class="rate">{{dashboard.approvalLabel}}</view></view><view><view class="muted">驳回率</view><view class="rate">{{dashboard.rejectionLabel}}</view></view></view><view class="muted">更新于 {{dashboard.updatedLabel}}</view></view>
 <view class="panel"><view class="heading">高频驳回标签</view><view wx:for="{{dashboard.high_frequency_tags}}" wx:key="tag" class="row item"><text>{{item.tag}}</text><text>{{item.rejection_count}} 次</text></view><view wx:if="{{!dashboard.high_frequency_tags.length}}" class="empty">当前范围暂无驳回记录</view></view>
 <view class="panel"><view class="heading">月度克制趋势</view><view wx:for="{{dashboard.monthly_trend}}" wx:key="month" class="item stack"><view class="row"><text>{{item.month}}</text><text>克制率 {{item.rateLabel}}</text></view><view class="track"><view class="fill" style="width:{{item.bar}}%;"></view></view><view class="muted">{{item.application_count}} 次申请 · {{item.rejection_count}} 次驳回 · 驳回金额 {{item.amountLabel}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!dashboard.monthly_trend.length}}" class="empty">当前范围暂无月度数据</view></view></block>
 <view class="panel"><view class="heading">标签分类统计</view><view wx:if="{{tagsError}}" class="error">{{tagsError}}</view><view wx:for="{{tagItems}}" wx:key="tag" class="item"><view class="row"><text>{{item.tag}}</text><text>{{item.application_count}} 次申请</text></view><view class="muted">驳回 {{item.rejection_count}} 次 · 驳回金额 {{item.amountLabel}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!loading && !tagsError && !tagItems.length}}" class="empty">暂无分类数据</view></view>
 <view class="panel"><view class="heading">{{period}} 好友克制PK</view><view class="muted">仅展示已确认且双方授权的好友。排名与评分使用服务端结果。</view><view wx:if="{{pkError}}" class="error">{{pkError}}</view><view wx:for="{{pkItems}}" wx:key="position" class="item stack"><view class="row"><text>{{item.position}}　{{item.nickname || '微信用户'}}</text><text>{{item.scoreLabel}} 分</text></view><view class="muted">驳回率 {{item.rateLabel}} · 省钱 {{item.saving_count}} 次</view></view><view wx:if="{{!loading && !pkError && !pkItems.length}}" class="empty">暂无可展示的授权好友数据</view><view wx:if="{{metricVersion}}" class="form-hint">指标版本 {{metricVersion}}</view></view>
 <button wx:if="{{dashboardError || tagsError || pkError}}" class="btn soft" bindtap="load" disabled="{{loading}}">重新获取统计</button>
</view>
